@paymentBaseUrl = http://localhost:5204
@token = replace-with-a-valid-jwt
@orderId = 1
@declineOrderId = 2

### Initiate a mock successful payment (the idempotency key must be reused for retries)
POST {{paymentBaseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "idempotencyKey": "local-checkout-order-1",
  "paymentMethod": "mock-success"
}

### Check the current user's most recent payment for an order
GET {{paymentBaseUrl}}/api/payments/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exercise a mock decline with a different unpaid order and idempotency key
POST {{paymentBaseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{declineOrderId}},
  "idempotencyKey": "local-checkout-order-2-decline",
  "paymentMethod": "mock-decline"
}
